WEBVTT

00:00:25.610 --> 00:00:27.630
I am not that perfect,

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:30.400
but I hope you will learn to accept me.

00:02:04.810 --> 00:02:06.480
Kaoru-sama...

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:08.440
It's all right, Aoi-chan.

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:17.950
That'll do it.

00:02:17.950 --> 00:02:19.530
Here, Aoi-chan.

00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:22.450
Wow!

00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:23.740
Thank you, Kaoru-sama!

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:55.020
Oh, no! This late already?

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:29.310
I'm so hungry.

00:03:34.110 --> 00:03:34.840
Here.

00:03:34.840 --> 00:03:35.360
Emm!

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:36.690
Thank you!

00:03:36.690 --> 00:03:38.940
I've got your favorite today.

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:42.530
Tokyo... Tokyo...

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:46.160
Please transfer if you're using
all JR lines or any subway lines.

00:03:54.590 --> 00:03:56.540
Which one should I take?

00:03:57.730 --> 00:03:59.130
Um...

00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:00.030
Pardon...

00:04:13.840 --> 00:04:16.170
A cherry blossom pattern, huh?

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:22.740
I wonder why I cannot go through this gate?

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:35.200
Um...

00:04:36.530 --> 00:04:38.430
Um, are you all right?

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:44.230
Oh, I am sorry.

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:48.720
Thank you so much.

00:04:50.810 --> 00:04:52.890
Oh, the sandal strap...

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:54.720
How troublesome.

00:04:54.720 --> 00:04:56.420
What should I do?

00:04:56.420 --> 00:04:59.610
Can you hang onto my shoulder for a bit?

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:00.730
It's all right.

00:05:00.730 --> 00:05:02.290
S-Sure...

00:05:06.860 --> 00:05:10.800
It's unusual for someone of your age to wear a tsumugi.

00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:13.300
Your obi has a nice spring design, too.

00:05:13.300 --> 00:05:16.040
You know a lot about kimonos..

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:16.870
Just a bit.

00:05:29.850 --> 00:05:31.320
This is all right.

00:05:31.320 --> 00:05:32.550
I think it's fine though.

00:05:32.550 --> 00:05:35.040
It's temporary, make sure to properly fix it later.

00:05:36.020 --> 00:05:39.460
Thank you so much for your kindness.

00:05:39.460 --> 00:05:40.690
Oh, it's all right.

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:42.400
Then I'll excuse myself.

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:43.790
Hold on.

00:05:43.790 --> 00:05:44.280
Yes?

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:46.740
That's a Hokubu line ticket, right?

00:05:46.740 --> 00:05:49.600
So your gate is way over there.

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:51.570
I see.

00:05:51.570 --> 00:05:53.540
How will I be able to reach it?

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:54.980
Let's see.

00:05:54.980 --> 00:05:58.950
You go straight here, turn left at the T-intersection,

00:05:58.950 --> 00:06:00.910
turn right at the first flight of stairs...

00:06:02.220 --> 00:06:04.630
Um, did you get that?

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:05.840
Eh.

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:09.490
Probably, I believe I will be all right.

00:06:09.490 --> 00:06:10.260
Straight...

00:06:12.760 --> 00:06:14.090
Straight...

00:06:13.060 --> 00:06:17.640
If you'd like, I'll go with you since
I'm going home on the same train.

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:19.060
Is that all right?

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:20.690
Thank you so much!

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:22.320
You even fixed my strap.

00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:24.590
I will never forget this!

00:06:24.590 --> 00:06:26.450
That's a little much...

00:06:29.480 --> 00:06:32.200
It's hard to switch trains in Tokyo, isn't it?

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:33.550
Yes.

00:06:33.550 --> 00:06:36.160
I do not comprehend any of it.

00:06:36.620 --> 00:06:39.870
I got lost often too when I started going to college.

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:42.000
Are you a college student?

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:44.500
Yeah, I started junior year this spring.

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:47.720
You are very dexterous.

00:06:47.720 --> 00:06:48.500
Huh!

00:06:48.500 --> 00:06:49.860
Oh, the sandal strap.

00:06:49.860 --> 00:06:52.050
You seem to know a lot about kimonos as well.

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:57.570
I got dressed up in traditional
Japanese clothes a lot as a kid.

00:06:57.570 --> 00:07:00.060
Mom used to wear the tsumugi a lot, too.

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:04.520
So it just doesn't seem like I'm talking to a stranger...

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:07.280
Sorry if I'm being annoying.

00:07:07.280 --> 00:07:08.530
No, not at all.

00:07:08.530 --> 00:07:10.740
You helped me out so much.

00:07:10.740 --> 00:07:15.740
I had no idea what Tokyo was like and it made me so worried.

00:07:15.740 --> 00:07:19.330
I am very relieved you seem to be someone who likes kimonos.

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:22.160
Toyamadai... Toyamadai...

00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:25.170
We will be waiting for an express train to pass.

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:26.810
We finally can sit.

00:07:26.810 --> 00:07:27.380
Yeah.

00:07:28.370 --> 00:07:30.270
One, two...

00:07:30.270 --> 00:07:32.390
Izumigaoka is four stations away.

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:33.610
That's right.

00:07:35.140 --> 00:07:37.850
She said it's her first time in Tokyo?

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:40.390
It doesn't look like she's here as a tourist.

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:42.690
Maybe a boyfriend?

00:07:43.250 --> 00:07:45.250
Is something on my face?

00:07:45.250 --> 00:07:47.390
No, n-not really...

00:07:47.390 --> 00:07:49.660
Um, can I ask you something?

00:07:49.660 --> 00:07:50.400
Yes?

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:52.130
Why are you in Tokyo?

00:07:52.130 --> 00:07:55.070
Actually, to see {someone}a certain person.

00:07:55.070 --> 00:07:57.280
Could it be a guy?

00:07:57.280 --> 00:07:58.660
Y-Yes.

00:08:00.270 --> 00:08:02.250
I was just joking.

00:08:08.680 --> 00:08:10.810
But I came here on a whim,

00:08:10.810 --> 00:08:15.020
not knowing if I will meet him or not.

00:08:15.020 --> 00:08:19.290
I have no idea about the roads, and I was very troubled.

00:08:19.290 --> 00:08:22.750
So I really appreciate someone guiding me like this.

00:08:25.090 --> 00:08:28.260
I have not stepped outside by myself that much, so...

00:08:28.260 --> 00:08:33.360
I am rather relieved and now I feel rather sleepy.

00:08:37.140 --> 00:08:40.600
Izumigaoka. Izumigaoka.

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:43.330
We're here.

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:44.620
This is Izumigaoka.

00:08:45.380 --> 00:08:46.630
Hey, come on.

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:49.340
Come on, wake up!

00:08:53.690 --> 00:08:55.250
The train departed.

00:08:56.960 --> 00:08:58.300
Oh, well...

00:08:58.890 --> 00:09:02.160
Simple or just clueless about the world?

00:09:02.160 --> 00:09:04.810
But she's rather cute.

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:13.370
I-I apologize! When did I...

00:09:13.370 --> 00:09:15.210
How much further?

00:09:15.210 --> 00:09:16.340
We're close.

00:09:16.340 --> 00:09:17.990
I almost slept past it.

00:09:17.990 --> 00:09:19.990
We've gone all the way around.

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:25.000
I really do apologize for all this trouble.

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:26.290
It's all right.

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:27.960
Nishiizumi City, right?

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:29.660
I live around there.

00:09:29.660 --> 00:09:30.960
I trouble you so.

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:37.130
What kind of person is this guy you're visiting?

00:09:37.130 --> 00:09:38.570
Well...

00:09:38.570 --> 00:09:42.740
I have not seen him for a long time, but he is very kind.

00:09:42.740 --> 00:09:47.940
It is as if I am relieved each time I think of him.

00:09:51.180 --> 00:09:52.110
What is it?

00:09:52.610 --> 00:09:58.020
I just recalled that something like this happened when I was little.

00:09:58.020 --> 00:10:01.920
The strap on my sandal broke back then like it did today,

00:10:01.920 --> 00:10:04.040
and he fixed it for me.

00:10:04.460 --> 00:10:08.690
Come to think of it, he must
have been very adept as well.

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:13.070
So you love this guy that much?

00:10:13.070 --> 00:10:16.420
Yes, he is the first person
that I have loved in my life.

00:10:16.880 --> 00:10:23.560
I feel blessed to have been born into this world when I think of him.

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:28.410
It's amazing to feel so much for one person.

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:31.950
I hope you get to see him soon.

00:10:31.950 --> 00:10:32.860
Yes.

00:10:37.190 --> 00:10:39.410
According to the note, it's around here.

00:10:39.410 --> 00:10:41.200
Yeah, no mistake.

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:42.620
Right around that corner!

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:46.750
He is beyond this corner.

00:11:06.550 --> 00:11:09.260
Um, there's no mistake...

00:11:09.260 --> 00:11:12.310
Well, this is the place if the note's right.

00:11:13.330 --> 00:11:14.800
That cannot be...

00:11:15.830 --> 00:11:16.730
It is a lie.

00:11:18.100 --> 00:11:19.500
I thought...

00:11:19.500 --> 00:11:21.610
I thought I would finally see him.

00:11:22.340 --> 00:11:24.130
This cannot be...

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:32.710
What should I do?

00:11:54.940 --> 00:11:56.970
Drink this and calm down.

00:11:58.680 --> 00:11:59.580
Yes.

00:12:05.530 --> 00:12:08.190
It's fine I had her come up,

00:12:08.190 --> 00:12:11.370
but how should I talk to her in this situation?

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:16.840
Um, you know...

00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:23.970
I can't help but feel sorry for her.

00:12:23.970 --> 00:12:25.890
I want her to see this guy somehow.

00:12:28.350 --> 00:12:32.060
Um, do you have any other clues?

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:39.420
A photograph of myself and him.

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:42.960
It's a photo from her childhood.

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:44.280
Huh!

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:47.230
Hey, I've seen this somewhere...

00:12:51.750 --> 00:12:55.120
Isn't this me and Aoi-chan?

00:12:56.500 --> 00:12:58.460
What did you just say?

00:12:58.460 --> 00:13:02.800
I just said this is a photo of me and Aoi-chan.

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:04.780
T-Then...

00:13:04.780 --> 00:13:06.840
You are Kaoru-sama?

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:08.140
Yeah.

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:10.350
I'm Hanabish Kaorui.

00:13:10.950 --> 00:13:13.150
Aoi-chan, it's all right.

00:13:14.990 --> 00:13:16.080
It's all right.

00:13:21.530 --> 00:13:26.330
Kaoru-sama!

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:33.670
For 18 years, I have been waiting so long for this moment!

00:13:34.680 --> 00:13:35.840
18 years?

00:13:35.840 --> 00:13:39.460
To think the person who was so kind to me was you.

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:43.050
I have never felt the thing called destiny more strongly than now!

00:13:44.050 --> 00:13:47.590
H-Hold on and explain this properly.

00:13:47.590 --> 00:13:49.090
I apologize.

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:59.560
I, Sakuraba Aoi, am here to wed you.

00:14:02.190 --> 00:14:03.980
Wife?

00:14:03.980 --> 00:14:07.070
Yes, I am to be your wife, Kaoru-sama!

00:14:07.070 --> 00:14:10.530
I-It's true that I remember you now, Aoi-chan.

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:12.580
But you, becoming my wife...

00:14:12.580 --> 00:14:17.540
The dream that I have had for 18 years is finally coming true.

00:14:17.540 --> 00:14:21.000
Now, please come back with me to the Hanabishi family.

00:14:21.750 --> 00:14:22.630
Hanabishi...

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:27.590
Return to Hanabishi, and we will be together.

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:30.760
I see.

00:14:30.760 --> 00:14:32.810
That's what they mean.

00:14:32.810 --> 00:14:34.060
Kaoru-sama?

00:14:34.710 --> 00:14:39.120
They can come straight to me
if they want me back in Hanabishi.

00:14:39.120 --> 00:14:42.520
Trying to lure me back by using a girl.

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:44.780
I trust them even less now!

00:14:44.780 --> 00:14:47.110
K-Kaoru-sama...

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:50.820
Aoi-chan, I won't go back to Hanabishi.

00:14:50.820 --> 00:14:52.830
I'm sorry, but please leave now!

00:14:55.170 --> 00:14:57.230
K-Kaoru-sama!

00:15:05.410 --> 00:15:07.210
Kaoru-sama...

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:11.670
You really left Hanabishi
because you did not like me.

00:15:15.320 --> 00:15:17.920
I was almost fooled by them.

00:15:17.920 --> 00:15:21.060
I'm sure those Hanabishi guys rigged all this.

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:27.400
When they find that their plan failed, I'm sure someone'll pick her up.

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:31.900
There, like I said.

00:15:31.900 --> 00:15:33.340
Someone's here to...

00:15:35.910 --> 00:15:37.450
They aren't from Hanabishi!

00:15:40.280 --> 00:15:42.050
You alone, girl?

00:15:42.050 --> 00:15:43.710
Wanna go karaoke?

00:15:44.280 --> 00:15:46.220
Let's go karaoke!

00:15:46.220 --> 00:15:49.020
You'd catch a cold staying out here!

00:15:49.020 --> 00:15:50.820
Or do ya wanna go eat?

00:15:50.820 --> 00:15:53.930
We know a joint that has an ocean view!

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:56.050
Hold it right there!

00:15:56.700 --> 00:15:58.160
Huh? What's this?

00:15:58.160 --> 00:15:59.890
We don't need guys here.

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:01.730
K-Kaoru-sama?

00:16:01.730 --> 00:16:03.800
You trying to take her away?

00:16:03.800 --> 00:16:06.510
We asked her out first!

00:16:06.510 --> 00:16:08.570
Why don't ya say something, huh?

00:16:08.570 --> 00:16:12.540
I-It's all well that I jumped out, but they look pretty strong...

00:16:12.540 --> 00:16:15.450
What should I do... Um... Uh...

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:17.120
Huh?

00:16:18.870 --> 00:16:21.450
S-S-She...

00:16:21.450 --> 00:16:22.690
She's my girl!

00:16:22.690 --> 00:16:23.830
Got a problem?

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:27.380
Kaoru-sama...

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:29.060
Oh no...

00:16:29.060 --> 00:16:31.800
Did I just say something really outrageous?

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:34.300
Damn, she's already taken.

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:37.430
Don't make a girl wait all by herself around here!

00:16:37.430 --> 00:16:38.180
Let's go.

00:16:38.180 --> 00:16:39.270
Damn it.

00:16:46.240 --> 00:16:48.150
Oh, were you scared?

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:49.320
It's all right.

00:16:52.220 --> 00:16:53.610
It's all right.

00:16:54.220 --> 00:16:55.690
That is not it.

00:16:55.690 --> 00:17:01.200
Even if it was a lie, I am happy you would say I was your girl.

00:17:03.700 --> 00:17:04.680
That's true.

00:17:05.730 --> 00:17:09.130
A good girl like her
would never do that.

00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:11.540
I'm sorry.

00:17:11.540 --> 00:17:13.880
I was out of my mind and jumped to conclusions.

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:15.840
Well, let's return to my room.

00:17:16.340 --> 00:17:18.300
My feet hurt standing here.

00:17:19.580 --> 00:17:20.140
Okay?

00:17:20.470 --> 00:17:22.140
Kaoru-sama.

00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:29.690
Fiancé, you and me?

00:17:29.690 --> 00:17:30.900
Yes.

00:17:30.900 --> 00:17:34.150
We have seen each other a few times when we were young.

00:17:50.840 --> 00:17:55.480
Since then, I was raised to be your wife, Kaoru-sama.

00:17:55.480 --> 00:17:58.590
To do everything I can for you.

00:17:59.050 --> 00:18:01.750
You did not know this, Kaoru-sama?

00:18:03.220 --> 00:18:06.390
I recall something along those lines at some point,

00:18:06.390 --> 00:18:07.520
but nothing concrete.

00:18:08.030 --> 00:18:12.020
But they suddenly told me
to forget this promise was made.

00:18:12.760 --> 00:18:17.030
I wanted to meet you in person and hear the truth from you.

00:18:17.030 --> 00:18:19.070
That's why you're here.

00:18:19.070 --> 00:18:22.240
I didn't leave because I didn't like you.

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:25.700
Well, a lot happened back there.

00:18:29.050 --> 00:18:30.640
Thank goodness.

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:35.090
You're tired, right?

00:18:35.090 --> 00:18:36.590
You should rest well tonight.

00:18:37.320 --> 00:18:40.790
Um, is it all right for me to stay here?

00:18:40.790 --> 00:18:43.160
It's getting pretty late.

00:18:43.160 --> 00:18:45.260
I'll get the bath ready now.

00:18:45.260 --> 00:18:48.640
Oh, you told your folks you were coming here, right?

00:18:48.640 --> 00:18:50.840
Y-Yes, of course!

00:18:50.840 --> 00:18:52.690
I do not need to contact them!

00:18:55.670 --> 00:18:57.610
Then I will take a bath now.

00:18:57.980 --> 00:18:59.140
You must be cold.

00:18:59.140 --> 00:19:00.550
Take your time and warm up.

00:19:00.550 --> 00:19:01.540
Yes.

00:19:04.620 --> 00:19:08.290
To think that a girl is taking a bath in my room...

00:19:08.290 --> 00:19:10.090
That's kinda amazing.

00:19:10.090 --> 00:19:12.580
It's the first time that a girl has been here.

00:19:22.330 --> 00:19:23.740
Wow...

00:19:23.740 --> 00:19:28.350
Why does it sound so perverted when
undressing traditional clothing?

00:19:53.290 --> 00:19:55.800
18 years, huh?

00:19:55.800 --> 00:19:57.960
I didn't hear anything about it.

00:20:04.610 --> 00:20:06.080
It's a problem.

00:20:06.080 --> 00:20:09.780
She's a really nice girl, and I don't feel bad about this,

00:20:09.780 --> 00:20:13.350
but it's so sudden I can't get my head out of the clouds.

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:26.620
Is something wrong?

00:20:27.400 --> 00:20:28.970
N-No...

00:20:28.970 --> 00:20:30.120
Nothing is wrong.

00:20:30.940 --> 00:20:32.630
Oh, I-I see...

00:20:40.910 --> 00:20:44.080
S-She was wearing this kinda underwear?

00:21:05.370 --> 00:21:06.840
Thank goodness.

00:21:08.270 --> 00:21:11.330
Kaoru-sama did not hate me...

00:21:13.110 --> 00:21:18.790
I am truly blessed that I was able to meet Kaoru-sama.

00:22:51.390 --> 00:22:55.480
If Kaoru-sama wishes, I'd like to do anything.

00:22:56.560 --> 00:22:57.430
Sleeping next to you?

00:22:58.770 --> 00:23:00.920
Ai Yori Aoshi, Supper.

00:23:01.770 --> 00:23:05.230
I always stay by your side.
